      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Bateman et al.",
        "AbstractText": "We report here the second draft genome sequence of a bloodstream isolate of Haemophilus influenzae serotype f. Three discrete 3.1- to 7.8-kb sites contained 80% of the variability in the genome, consistent with recombination in known virulence factors."
